    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological horror experience where exploration, tension, and environmental storytelling guide you through a decaying world full of secrets best left buried. What was meant to be just another exploration quickly unravels into something far more disturbing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With only your instincts and your resolve, you\u2019ll need to push forward, and piece together what really happened beneath the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive First-Person Exploration</strong>: Navigate unsettling spaces with realistic environmental detail and atmosphere driven horror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Storytelling</strong>: Clues, letters, and hidden visuals build a deeper mystery across the environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Subtle Puzzle &amp; Interaction Design</strong>: Progress by observing your environment, using key items, and paying attention to what others missed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demo Built for Tension</strong>: The demo includes the early stage of the game. a taste of some puzzles, interactions, story, creeping dread and discovery. So you can experience what the game is about.</p></li></ul>",
